    prim:composeArrowFirst prim:sub_Bignum_Integer ; prim:composeArrowSecond prim:sub_Integer_Rational ; prim:composeArrowInto prim:compArr_Bignum_Rational ;
    rdfs:label "Bignum ⊂+ Rational" ;
    rdfs:comment "The composite subtype morphism prim:Bignum → prim:Rational along the subtyping chain: prim:arrowDom prim:Bignum, prim:arrowCod prim:Rational, canonically decomposed as composeArrowSecond prim:sub_Integer_Rational ∘ composeArrowFirst prim:sub_Bignum_Integer (first the direct step out of prim:Bignum, then the arrow up to prim:Rational), with composeArrowInto this arrow itself. Being the unique arrow of its ordered pair in the thin category, it is the on-the-nose associative witness for every bracketing of the chain, and one member of the representable hom-set Hom(-, prim:Rational)." .
