prim:repr_Bag a prim:RepresentablePresheaf ; prim:representableOf prim:Bag ;
    prim:homSetHasArrow prim:sub_Set_Bag , prim:id_Bag ;
    rdfs:label "Hom(-, Bag)" ;
    rdfs:comment "The representable presheaf Hom(-, prim:Bag) — the image of object prim:Bag under the Yoneda embedding yo — whose materialised hom-set (prim:homSetHasArrow) is the 2 arrow(s) of the formal category with prim:arrowCod prim:Bag, i.e. the down-set of subtypes X <: prim:Bag with one arrow apiece, always including the reflexive identity id_Bag. STEP C (taiji.ttl) lifts this hook to the full literal Yoneda embedding and ρ-naturality." .
